 as Lac du Réaltor (Provence, France) (Fig. 3 E) by Luc Ector and Carlos E. Wetzel (LIST Luxemburg) who, despite an exhaustive review of existing Gomphonema literature, could not assign a name to this species (Wetzel, pers. comm.). It is likely that the species is more abundant than currently known due to confusion with similar taxa, such as G. jadwigiae Lange-Bertalot & E. Reichardt and G. turris Ehrenberg (see Discussion below).","","text","",""]]},"PY98C":{"d":[["Europe & Northern Asia (excluding China)","","text","",""]]},"QB9XY":{"d":[["Africa","","text","",""]]},"QBTC3":{"d":[["Feni Island (eastern Bismarck Archipelago)","","text","",""]]},"QJTN":{"d":[["","LSI","tdwg","",""]]},"QXLP8":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"R25N6":{"d":[["CR","CR","iso","",""],["Puntarenas","","text","",""]]},"RGWM":{"d":[["THA","THA","tdwg","",""]]},"RYGS8":{"d":[["Australia (Victoria)","","text","",""]]},"SLJT":{"d":[["Southern Asia","","text","",""]]},"SLXSS":{"d":[["","CO","iso","native",""]]},"SWGTX":{"d":[["Distribution. Democratic Republic of Congo (De Saeger 1943), Egypt (Fahringer 1927), Ethiopia (Szepligeti 1913), Yemen (new record). Possibly also South Africa and Tanzania (Brues 1926: 210, as Microbracon recessus Szepligeti, explained in De Saeger 1943: 375).","","text","",""]]},"SX65G":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"T2KXT":{"d":[["South America","","text","",""]]},"T9QWH":{"d":[["Norway","NO","iso","",""]]},"TXQYG":{"d":[["East Antarctic Wilkes Land","21858","mrgid","native",""],["South Sandwich Islands","21929","mrgid","native",""],["West Antarctica","9733","mrgid","native",""]]},"TYZDR":{"d":[["Bohol","19682","mrgid","native",""]]},"V28WF":{"d":[["Palawan; Philippines (Luzon)","","text","",""]]},"V296F":{"d":[["Palawan; Philippines (Luzon, Mindoro, Negros)","","text","",""]]},"V3X4H":{"d":[["Peru (Huanuco, Pasco)","","text","",""]]},"V57PK":{"d":[["Colombia","","text","",""]]},"VCCN3":{"d":[["Vermont","48488","mrgid","",""]]},"VGL4":{"d":[["New Zealand 